OL,3,GNEWSACar rally brings boost to
OL,4,AShropshire businesses
OL,5,
OL,6,FA car rally in the Shropshire
OL,7,Fcountryside has been credited with
OL,8,Fbringing extra business to towns along
OL,9,Fthe route.
OL,11,FThe Hills Ford Rally Stages event was
OL,12,Fheld in the county for the first time
OL,13,Fover the weekend of September 19-20,
OL,14,Fwith a ceremonial start in Shrewsbury.
OL,16,FSeb Slater from Shrewsbury Business
OL,17,FImprovement District (BID), a group
OL,18,Fwhich represents businesses in the
OL,19,Ftown, said footfall had been up 26%
OL,20,Fcompared to the previous year.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
