OL,3,GNEWSACar rally brings boost to
OL,4,AShropshire businesses
OL,5,
OL,6,FHeather Kidd, the leader of Shropshire
OL,7,FCouncil, said: "We know that a lot of
OL,8,Fthe pubs and restaurants were full, so
OL,9,Fthe economic impact was huge."
